{% comment %}

  DISTRIBUIDORA LA ÚNICA

  Selector de sede Centro / Sur — versión configurada para Centro

  Estilo basado en las secciones de la tienda (tarjetas de categorías)

  Instalar este mismo snippet en:

  - https://distrilaunica.com.co/

  - https://sur.distrilaunica.com.co/

  TIPOGRAFÍAS (manual de marca):

  - Título del modal: Lapsus Pro Bold

  - Sedes y textos:   Arial Rounded MT Bold

  Para que Lapsus Pro Bold se vea, sube el archivo de la fuente

  (LapsusPro-Bold.woff2) a Assets del tema, en ambas tiendas.

  Si el archivo no existe, se usa Arial Rounded MT Bold / Arial

  como respaldo y todo sigue funcionando.

  COLORES (manual de marca):

  - Sede Sur:    tarjeta verde #7fb32c

  - Sede Centro: tarjeta amarilla #f7d52c

  - Útiles (lápices, regla y arco): blanco, con detalles en un tono más oscuro

    de la tarjeta (--dlu-tone)

  - Botón y franja del modal: azul oscuro #1b3c73 / azul #1881c1

  ÚTILES:

  Están dibujados en SVG dentro de cada tarjeta (busca "Útiles escolares"

  en el HTML), así que no hace falta subir ninguna imagen.

  ANIMACIONES:

  - Entrada: las tarjetas y los arcos aparecen con rebote.

  - Hover / foco / toque: el avioncito vuela por toda la tarjeta (con rizo),

    las letras del nombre saltan una a una, los lápices y la regla suben y el botón brilla.

  - Al elegir una sede: confeti blanco y azul desde el botón.

  Todo se desactiva con "reducir movimiento" del sistema.

  IMPORTANTE: en la constante FALLBACK_STORE (más abajo) se define la sede

  que se marca como "Estás aquí" cuando el dominio no es ninguno de los

  dos oficiales (por ejemplo, el editor de temas o la vista previa de Shopify).

    - En la tienda SUR    -> 'sur'

    - En la tienda CENTRO -> 'centro'

  Desarrollado por Interacstudio

{% endcomment %}

<style>

  /* =========================================================

     FUENTES DE MARCA

     ========================================================= */

  @font-face {

    font-family: 'Lapsus Pro';

    font-weight: 700;

    font-style: normal;

    font-display: swap;

  }

  /* =========================================================

     SELECTOR DE SEDE

     ========================================================= */

  #dlu-store-selector {

    /* Paleta del manual de marca */

    --dlu-yellow: #f7d52c;

    --dlu-pink: #df408a;

    --dlu-magenta: #bd0d65;

    --dlu-blue: #1881c1;

    --dlu-navy: #df408a;

    --dlu-orange: #f7a82c;

    --dlu-green: #7fb32c;

    --dlu-ink: #1f1d1f;

    --dlu-background: #ffffff;

    --dlu-muted: #5f5c66;

    --dlu-overlay: rgba(113, 122, 138, 0.62);

    --dlu-font-display: 'Lapsus Pro', 'Arial Rounded MT Bold', 'Arial Rounded MT', Arial, sans-serif;

    --dlu-font-text: 'Arial Rounded MT Bold', 'Arial Rounded MT', Arial, sans-serif;

    position: fixed;

    inset: 0;

    z-index: 999999999;

    display: none;

    align-items: center;

    justify-content: center;

    padding: 24px;

    background: var(--dlu-overlay);

    opacity: 0;

    visibility: hidden;

    transition:

      opacity 0.25s ease,

      visibility 0.25s ease;

    box-sizing: border-box;

    overflow-y: auto;

    font-family: var(--dlu-font-text);

  }

  #dlu-store-selector *,

  #dlu-store-selector *::before,

  #dlu-store-selector *::after {

    box-sizing: border-box;

  }

  #dlu-store-selector.is-visible {

    display: flex;

    opacity: 1;

    visibility: visible;

  }

  .dlu-selector__dialog {

    position: relative;

    width: 100%;

    max-width: 700px;

    padding: 50px 36px 36px;

    overflow: hidden;

    background: var(--dlu-background);

    color: var(--dlu-ink);

    border-radius: 28px;

    box-shadow:

      0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.10),

      0 30px 80px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.20);

    transform: translateY(20px) scale(0.97);

    transition: transform 0.45s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);

  }

  #dlu-store-selector.is-visible .dlu-selector__dialog {

    transform: translateY(0) scale(1);

  }

  /* Franja superior en azul de marca */

  .dlu-selector__dialog::before {

    content: '';

    position: absolute;

    top: 0;

    left: 0;

    right: 0;

    height: 6px;

    background: var(--dlu-blue);

  }

  /* ================================

     HEADER

     ================================ */

  .dlu-selector__header {

    max-width: 500px;

    margin: 0 auto 30px;

    text-align: center;

  }

  .dlu-selector__title {

    margin: 0 0 10px;

    font-family: var(--dlu-font-display);

    font-size: 36px;

    font-weight: 700;

    line-height: 1.1;

    letter-spacing: 0;

    color: var(--dlu-blue);

  }

  .dlu-selector__description {

    margin: 0;

    font-family: var(--dlu-font-text);

    font-size: 15px;

    font-weight: 400;

    line-height: 1.55;

    color: var(--dlu-muted);

  }

  /* ================================

     SEDES

     (tarjetas planas, como las categorías de la tienda)

     ================================ */

  .dlu-selector__stores {

    display: grid;

    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));

    gap: 16px;

  }

  .dlu-selector__store {

    --dlu-card: var(--dlu-green);

    --dlu-arch: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.30);

    --dlu-tone: #3f6b0c;

    --dlu-button: var(--dlu-navy);

    position: relative;

    display: flex;

    flex-direction: column;

    justify-content: space-between;

    min-height: 230px;

    padding: 26px 26px 24px;

    overflow: hidden;

    isolation: isolate;

    text-decoration: none;

    font-family: var(--dlu-font-text);

    font-weight: 700;

    color: var(--dlu-ink);

    background: var(--dlu-card);

    border-radius: 24px;

    box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.10);

    cursor: pointer;

    transition:

      transform 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1),

      box-shadow 0.25s ease;

  }

  /* Sede Sur: tarjeta verde, útiles en blanco, botón azul oscuro */

  .dlu-selector__store[data-store="sur"] {

    --dlu-card: var(--dlu-green);

    --dlu-arch: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.30);

    --dlu-tone: #3f6b0c;

    --dlu-button: var(--dlu-navy);

  }

  /* Sede Centro: tarjeta amarilla, útiles en blanco, botón azul oscuro */

  .dlu-selector__store[data-store="centro"] {

    --dlu-card: var(--dlu-yellow);

    --dlu-arch: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.50);

    --dlu-tone: #9a6b00;

    --dlu-button: var(--dlu-navy);

  }

  .dlu-selector__store:hover,

  .dlu-selector__store:focus-visible {

    transform: translateY(-5px);

    box-shadow: 0 20px 36px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.20);

  }

  .dlu-selector__store:focus-visible {

    outline: 3px solid var(--dlu-navy);

    outline-offset: 3px;

  }

  /* Al elegir: la tarjeta se "aprieta" mientras sale el confeti */

  .dlu-selector__store.is-selected {

    transform: scale(0.97);

  }

  /* ================================

     ÚTILES ESCOLARES (lápices y regla dentro de un arco, como las categorías)

     ================================ */

  .dlu-selector__shape {

    position: absolute;

    z-index: -1;

    pointer-events: none;

  }

    /* Útiles escolares: ilustración limpia con acentos de la marca */

  .dlu-selector__shape--supplies {

    right: 3%;

    bottom: 0;

    width: 38%;

    height: auto;

    overflow: visible;

  }

  .dlu-selector__supply {

    transform-box: fill-box;

    transform-origin: center bottom;

    transition: transform 0.55s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1) calc(var(--k, 0) * 70ms);

  }

  .dlu-selector__arch-shape { fill: var(--dlu-arch); }

  .dlu-selector__s-white { fill: #ffffff; }

  .dlu-selector__s-wood { fill: #f6d9a8; }

  .dlu-selector__s-tone { fill: var(--dlu-tone); }

  .dlu-selector__s-ridge { fill: var(--dlu-tone); opacity: 0.18; }

  .dlu-selector__s-blue { fill: #1881c1; }

  .dlu-selector__s-blue-soft { fill: #bfe5f8; }

  .dlu-selector__s-pink { fill: #df408a; }

  .dlu-selector__s-pink-soft { fill: #ffd1e5; }

  .dlu-selector__s-orange { fill: #f7a82c; }

  .dlu-selector__s-metal { fill: #d8e0e7; }

  .dlu-selector__s-outline {

    stroke: var(--dlu-tone);

    stroke-width: 1.35;

    stroke-linejoin: round;

  }

  .dlu-selector__s-ticks {

    fill: none;

    stroke: var(--dlu-tone);

    stroke-width: 1.45;

    stroke-linecap: round;

    opacity: 0.85;

  }

  /* Las piezas se elevan en secuencia para dar profundidad al conjunto */

  .dlu-selector__store:hover .dlu-selector__pencil,

  .dlu-selector__store:focus-visible .dlu-selector__pencil { transform: translateY(-13px); }

  .dlu-selector__store:hover .dlu-selector__ruler,

  .dlu-selector__store:focus-visible .dlu-selector__ruler { transform: translateY(-9px); }

  .dlu-selector__store:hover .dlu-selector__eraser,

  .dlu-selector__store:focus-visible .dlu-selector__eraser { transform: translateY(-7px) rotate(-5deg); }

  .dlu-selector__store:hover .dlu-selector__arch,

  .dlu-selector__store:focus-visible .dlu-selector__arch { transform: translateY(-5px); }

  /* ================================

     DECORACIÓN: ruta punteada y avioncito de papel

     Capa de fondo: líneas punteadas.

     Capa superior: avioncito.

     ================================ */

  .dlu-selector__deco {

    position: absolute;

    inset: 0;

    width: 100%;

    height: 100%;

    pointer-events: none;

  }

  .dlu-selector__deco--back {

    z-index: -1;

  }

  .dlu-selector__deco--front {

    z-index: 3;

    filter: drop-shadow(0 3px 3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.18));

    animation: dlu-bob 3s ease-in-out infinite alternate;

  }

  .dlu-selector__deco-path {

    fill: none;

    stroke: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);

    stroke-width: 2.5;

    stroke-linecap: round;

    stroke-dasharray: 2 9;

  }

  @keyframes dlu-bob {

    from { transform: translateY(0); }

    to   { transform: translateY(-4px); }

  }

  /* ================================

     CONTENIDO DE LA SEDE

     ================================ */

  .dlu-selector__store-eyebrow {

    display: block;

    margin: 0 0 6px;

    font-family: var(--dlu-font-text);

    font-size: 15px;

    font-weight: 700;

    line-height: 1.2;

    letter-spacing: 0.16em;

    text-transform: uppercase;

    color: var(--dlu-ink);

    opacity: 0.8;

  }

  .dlu-selector__store-name {

    position: relative;

    margin: 0;

    font-family: var(--dlu-font-text);

    font-size: 50px;

    font-weight: 700;

    line-height: 1;

    letter-spacing: 0.01em;

    text-transform: uppercase;

    color: var(--dlu-ink);

  }

  /* Letras que saltan una a una al hacer hover */

  .dlu-selector__letter {

    display: inline-block;

  }

  .dlu-selector__store:hover .dlu-selector__letter,

  .dlu-selector__store:focus-visible .dlu-selector__letter {

    animation: dlu-hop 0.65s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1) calc(var(--i) * 70ms) both;

  }

  @keyframes dlu-hop {

    0%   { transform: translateY(0) rotate(0); }

    35%  { transform: translateY(-13px) rotate(-6deg); }

    70%  { transform: translateY(2px) rotate(3deg); }

    100% { transform: translateY(0) rotate(0); }

  }

  /* Texto solo para lectores de pantalla (el nombre completo) */

  .dlu-selector__sr {

    position: absolute;

    width: 1px;

    height: 1px;

    margin: -1px;

    padding: 0;

    overflow: hidden;

    clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0);

    white-space: nowrap;

    border: 0;

  }

  /* Botón: píldora de color con brillo y rebote al hacer hover */

  .dlu-selector__store-action {

    position: relative;

    display: inline-flex;

    align-items: center;

    align-self: flex-start;

    gap: 10px;

    margin-top: 26px;

    padding: 13px 18px 13px 20px;

    overflow: hidden;

    font-family: var(--dlu-font-text);

    font-size: 13px;

    font-weight: 700;

    line-height: 1;

    letter-spacing: 0.04em;

    text-transform: uppercase;

    color: #ffffff;

    background: var(--dlu-button);

    border-radius: 100px;

    transition:

      transform 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1),

      box-shadow 0.25s ease;

  }

  /* Brillo que cruza el botón */

  .dlu-selector__store-action::after {

    content: '';

    position: absolute;

    top: 0;

    left: 0;

    width: 36%;

    height: 100%;

    background: linear-gradient(

      100deg,

      rgba(255, 255, 255, 0),

      rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4),

      rgba(255, 255, 255, 0)

    );

    transform: translateX(-130%) skewX(-20deg);

    pointer-events: none;

  }

  .dlu-selector__store:hover .dlu-selector__store-action,

  .dlu-selector__store:focus-visible .dlu-selector__store-action {

    transform: scale(1.07) translateX(3px);

    box-shadow: 0 8px 18px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.28);

  }

  .dlu-selector__store.is-selected .dlu-selector__store-action {

    transform: scale(1.12);

  }

  .dlu-selector__store:hover .dlu-selector__store-action::after,

  .dlu-selector__store:focus-visible .dlu-selector__store-action::after {

    animation: dlu-shine 0.9s ease 0.15s 1 both;

  }

  @keyframes dlu-shine {

    from { transform: translateX(-130%) skewX(-20deg); }

    to   { transform: translateX(480%) skewX(-20deg); }

  }

  .dlu-selector__store-action svg {

    flex: 0 0 auto;

    width: 17px;

    height: 17px;

  }

  .dlu-selector__store:hover .dlu-selector__store-action svg,

  .dlu-selector__store:focus-visible .dlu-selector__store-action svg {

    animation: dlu-arrow 0.7s ease 0.1s 2;

  }

  @keyframes dlu-arrow {

    0%, 100% { transform: translateX(0); }

    50%      { transform: translateX(5px); }

  }

  /* "Estás aquí": etiqueta blanca en la esquina superior derecha */

  .dlu-selector__current-badge {

    position: absolute;

    top: 16px;

    right: 16px;

    z-index: 2;

    display: none;

    align-items: center;

    padding: 7px 12px;

    font-family: var(--dlu-font-text);

    font-size: 12px;

    font-weight: 700;

    line-height: 1;

    white-space: nowrap;

    color: var(--dlu-ink);

    background: #ffffff;

    border-radius: 100px;

    box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);

  }

  .dlu-selector__store.is-current .dlu-selector__current-badge {

    display: inline-flex;

  }

  /* Confeti (lo crea el script al elegir una sede) */

  .dlu-selector__confetti {

    position: absolute;

    z-index: 4;

    border-radius: 50%;

    pointer-events: none;

  }

  /* ================================

     ENTRADA

     ================================ */

  #dlu-store-selector.is-visible .dlu-selector__store {

    animation: dlu-card-in 0.65s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1) 0.05s backwards;

  }

  #dlu-store-selector.is-visible .dlu-selector__store[data-store="centro"] {

    animation-delay: 0.2s;

  }

  #dlu-store-selector.is-visible .dlu-selector__shape--supplies {

    animation: dlu-arch-in 0.75s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1) 0.3s backwards;

  }

  @keyframes dlu-card-in {

    from {

      opacity: 0;

      transform: translateY(26px) scale(0.92) rotate(-1.5deg);

    }

  }

  @keyframes dlu-arch-in {

    from { transform: translateY(105%); }

  }

  /* ================================

     MÓVIL

     ================================ */

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {

    #dlu-store-selector {

      align-items: flex-start;

      padding: 16px;

    }

    .dlu-selector__dialog {

      max-width: 100%;

      margin: auto 0;

      padding: 40px 16px 18px;

      border-radius: 22px;

    }

    .dlu-selector__header {

      margin-bottom: 22px;

    }

    .dlu-selector__title {

      font-size: 28px;

    }

    .dlu-selector__description {

      font-size: 14px;

    }

    .dlu-selector__stores {

      grid-template-columns: 1fr;

      gap: 12px;

    }

    .dlu-selector__store {

      min-height: 190px;

      padding: 22px 20px 20px;

      border-radius: 20px;

    }

    .dlu-selector__store-name {

      font-size: 42px;

    }

    .dlu-selector__store-action {

      margin-top: 20px;

    }

  }

  /* ================================

     MOVIMIENTO REDUCIDO

     ================================ */

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {

    #dlu-store-selector,

    .dlu-selector__dialog,

    .dlu-selector__store,

    .dlu-selector__shape,

    .dlu-selector__supply,

    .dlu-selector__store-action {

      transition: none !important;

    }

    .dlu-selector__store,

    .dlu-selector__shape,

    .dlu-selector__letter,

    .dlu-selector__deco--front,

    .dlu-selector__store-action::after,

    .dlu-selector__store-action svg {

      animation: none !important;

    }

  }

</style>

<div

  id="dlu-store-selector"

  role="dialog"

  aria-modal="true"

  aria-labelledby="dlu-selector-title"

  aria-describedby="dlu-selector-description"

>

  <div class="dlu-selector__dialog">

    <div class="dlu-selector__header">

      <h2

        id="dlu-selector-title"

        class="dlu-selector__title"

      >

        ¿Dónde quieres comprar?

      </h2>

      <p

        id="dlu-selector-description"

        class="dlu-selector__description"

      >

        Selecciona la sede en la que deseas realizar tu compra.

      </p>

    </div>

    <div class="dlu-selector__stores">

     

      <!-- =========================

           CENTRO

           ========================= -->

      <a

        href="https://distrilaunica.com.co/"

        class="dlu-selector__store"

        data-store="centro"

      >

        <!-- Útiles escolares: lápices de colores, regla y borrador -->

        <svg

          class="dlu-selector__shape dlu-selector__shape--supplies"

          viewBox="0 0 160 190"

          aria-hidden="true"

          focusable="false"

        >

          <g class="dlu-selector__supply dlu-selector__arch" style="--k: 0">

            <path class="dlu-selector__arch-shape" d="M4 190V108A76 76 0 0 1 156 108V190Z"></path>

          </g>

          <!-- Borrador rosa al fondo -->

          <g class="dlu-selector__supply dlu-selector__eraser" style="--k: 2">

            <rect class="dlu-selector__s-pink dlu-selector__s-outline" x="123" y="144" width="28" height="14" rx="4"></rect>

            <path d="M137 145v12" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" opacity="0.8"></path>

            <path d="M126 147h7" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" opacity="0.8"></path>

          </g>

          <!-- Regla con borde, escala legible y remate azul -->

          <g class="dlu-selector__supply dlu-selector__ruler" style="--k: 1">

            <g transform="translate(22 190) rotate(-7)">

              <rect class="dlu-selector__s-white dlu-selector__s-outline" x="-9" y="-94" width="20" height="94" rx="3"></rect>

              <rect class="dlu-selector__s-blue" x="-9" y="-94" width="20" height="10" rx="3"></rect>

              <path class="dlu-selector__s-ticks" d="M-6 -16h9M-6 -26h5M-6 -36h9M-6 -46h5M-6 -56h9M-6 -66h5M-6 -76h9"></path>

            </g>

          </g>

          <!-- Lápiz azul -->

          <g class="dlu-selector__supply dlu-selector__pencil" style="--k: 2">

            <g transform="translate(61 190) rotate(-9)">

              <path class="dlu-selector__s-wood dlu-selector__s-outline" d="M-7 -105 0 -122 7 -105Z"></path>

              <path class="dlu-selector__s-blue" d="M-2.5 -116 0 -122 2.5 -116Z"></path>

              <rect class="dlu-selector__s-white dlu-selector__s-outline" x="-7" y="-106" width="14" height="90" rx="2.5"></rect>

              <rect class="dlu-selector__s-blue-soft" x="-3" y="-103" width="6" height="84" rx="1.5"></rect>

              <path class="dlu-selector__s-ridge" d="M4 -103v84"></path>

              <rect class="dlu-selector__s-metal" x="-7" y="-19" width="14" height="5" rx="1"></rect>

              <path d="M-5 -17h10M-5 -15h10" stroke="#6d8494" stroke-width="0.8"></path>

              <rect class="dlu-selector__s-blue" x="-7" y="-14" width="14" height="11" rx="2.5"></rect>

              <path d="M-5 -5h10" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="1.1" stroke-linecap="round" opacity="0.8"></path>

            </g>

          </g>

          <!-- Lápiz rosa, el más alto -->

          <g class="dlu-selector__supply dlu-selector__pencil" style="--k: 3">

            <g transform="translate(89 190)">

              <path class="dlu-selector__s-wood dlu-selector__s-outline" d="M-7 -119 0 -136 7 -119Z"></path>

              <path class="dlu-selector__s-pink" d="M-2.5 -130 0 -136 2.5 -130Z"></path>

              <rect class="dlu-selector__s-white dlu-selector__s-outline" x="-7" y="-120" width="14" height="104" rx="2.5"></rect>

              <rect class="dlu-selector__s-pink-soft" x="-3" y="-117" width="6" height="98" rx="1.5"></rect>

              <path class="dlu-selector__s-ridge" d="M4 -117v98"></path>

              <rect class="dlu-selector__s-metal" x="-7" y="-19" width="14" height="5" rx="1"></rect>

              <path d="M-5 -17h10M-5 -15h10" stroke="#6d8494" stroke-width="0.8"></path>

              <rect class="dlu-selector__s-pink" x="-7" y="-14" width="14" height="11" rx="2.5"></rect>

              <path d="M-5 -5h10" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="1.1" stroke-linecap="round" opacity="0.8"></path>

            </g>

          </g>

          <!-- Lápiz naranja -->

